# LeeAttend - Cursor Rules

## Core Rules (Absolute)
- **Docker-First:** Never run builds/tests on host. Use `./scripts/docker-helper.sh`.
- **Instruction Density:** Read `PROJECT_OS.md` for mandatory technical protocols.
- **File Length:** Maximum 200 lines per file.

## Project Structure
- `apiserver/`: Rust backend
- `agent-main/`: Rust edge agent
- `webdashboard/`: React frontend
- `docs/`: Documentation

## Context Discovery
- Read `llms.txt` for an index of all high-value documentation.
- Refer to `docs/docker-workflow.md` for understanding the layered Compose system.
